  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Los Ilustrados: Carlos III’s Enlightenment, printed for engineers of 2027",
    "overview": "Cream paper and plum ink. Real public-domain engravings (Van Hulsen corners, Carnicero’s balloon, the Puerta de Alcalá, a rococo cartouche) tinted with CSS masks; Cinzel wordmark with a Corinthia pen ’27; Ibarra Real Nova for reading, Brygada 1918 for labels and notes, Xanh Mono for every number.\n\nThe layout is editorial: visible rules, extreme scale contrast, asymmetry and typographic indexes instead of cards. Motion is printing-press motion: things ink, draw or uncover themselves once, with three timings and two curves.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Cream page, damask-of-lilies dark bands, no dark mode.",
      "Only real engravings with credits; never hand-drawn ornaments.",
      "Headlines in one tone, upright, with no highlighted words.",
      "Never italic small caps; all figures in Xanh Mono.",
      "Three timings, two curves, once-only scroll motion with a CSS fallback."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Palette Rule",
        "body": "Only the tokens in DESIGN.md; :root in app/globals.css is the only place in app/ that writes colours. npm test enforces it.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Engraving Rule",
        "body": "Only public-domain or CC0 engravings, each with an entry in assets/creditos.json.",
        "section": "imagery"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Press Motion Rule",
        "body": "--t-fast, --t-mid, --t-slow with --ease-out / --ease-io; scroll-linked motion only in CSS and only once.",
        "section": "motion"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do use typographic indexes and rules instead of cards.",
      "Do tint engravings with a mask over a palette colour.",
      "Do keep each new pattern in app/globals.css and DESIGN.md."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don’t use Geist, pill buttons, rounded panels or the old brand gradient rule.",
      "Don’t use shadows, gradients, glassmorphism, rays or gold gradients.",
      "Don’t highlight a headline word in italic colour.",
      "Don’t publish placeholder company logos.",
      "Don’t animate with JS on scroll."
